  m_Name: GoalHacker
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  battleItemType: 11
  itemName: Goal Hacker
  description: 'Tampers with 1 goal zone in range for 4s. If used on an ally goal
    zone: doubles any shield provided by the goal zone, and strengthens the goal
    zone''s HP restoration rate (restoring HP every 0.5s) for the duration of the
    effect. If used on an opposing goal zone: disables shield effects and HP restoration
    from that goal zone for the duration of the effect. Additional applications on
    an affected goal zone overrides the previous effects and refreshes the duration.'
  icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 037cafd8931db4e43b103fd4c66e997b, type: 3}
